{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1253.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"27c9673b1a180c39e4023cf7024b5801e481381f47bd701de98e692f6e0f8c09","ja":"みんな～、このHP見て！\nも～びっくりだよ～～～！","zh":"大家快看这个网页！\n真是惊呆我啦～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1253.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"500ae75465383f39b6f7c55a544c58135977cf61c1b50687b8bd1e22339d2de8","ja":"結婚式場のお知らせページですか～？\nええと……おやおや～。","zh":"是婚礼场地的通知页面吗～？\n呃……哎呀呀～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1253.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"69090364a4c223999e7445c7f7c2dd415656339cb1f4eece536b94f5a771902e","ja":"「アンケート結果、一部誤りのお詫びと訂正」……？\nこれ、この前のパンフレットのやつやん！？","zh":"“关于问卷调查结果部分错误的致歉与更正”……？\n这不是之前小册子上的那个吗？！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1253.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"dd9600afeeae817f3f63695a3508696e43727500c98c8aef5f076c9df0510dc6","ja":"なるほど～。『学生時代』にお相手に出会った方は、\n実は10パーセントくらいだったんですね～。","zh":"原来如此～。在“学生时代”遇到另一半的人，\n其实只有10%左右呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1253.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"658bb8bbfe848147012454f878f17a31ab5ff0c2ea62001d3b1e559548d6a9e4","ja":"それより職場とかで出会う人の方が\n多かったんや。","zh":"反倒是在职场之类的地方认识的人\n更多呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1253.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6ea252797cc7c5e90634f75b84492302cc6683ac0906c8be55f084e951012a8f","ja":"それじゃあやっぱり、私たちが結婚相手に\n出会うのって、まだまだ先なんだね。","zh":"这么说来，我们遇到结婚对象的时间，\n果然还是很久以后的事呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1253.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4282fa7b8192609be8153968bb26135a61985fc89559a5d3afaad01ce9eee72a","ja":"あはは、せやな！\nなんやすっかり気が抜けてもうたわ～♪","zh":"啊哈哈，确实呢！\n总觉得整个人一下子都放松下来了～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1253.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"fa3a0a47c9c24127d032939c8c5e929e85d15c8b51833b4dd82a159bed70cb2a","ja":"ですが、それでも10パーセント……。\nということは、劇場のみんなの人数を考えると……。","zh":"但是，即便如此也有10%……\n也就是说，考虑到剧场大家的人数……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1253.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"1eb2e974bfbda9210462a95aebf63c7c651acf9275f758fa79eb4a2332713e92","ja":"あれ！？　やっぱり周りの何人かは、\nもう出会っちゃってるかもってこと！？","zh":"哎！？也就是说身边果然已经有几个人，\n说不定已经遇到了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1253.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"e341228255c29439ade12bc9db69af757f5d133a163e838420bc8c16c233ad9d","ja":"はい、その可能性が。\nそれに、職場で出会う人が多いと言うことは……。","zh":"是的，有这个可能。\n而且，在职场上遇到的人多，也就意味着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1253.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"fc4d31eb36761e12b2f7aa7edc27a8aae1f4d16424035924300dfcfc016647a2","ja":"もうしばらくは、このアンケートのことが\n気になってしまいそうです。……ドキドキ。","zh":"在接下来的一段时间里，好像都会\n很在意这份问卷呢。……好紧张。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
